                return xxfnd_dff_pkg.render(
                           p_table_name   => 'XXCMP_PARTIES',
                           p_pk_value     => :P21_PARTY_ID,
                           p_reference_value => :P21_PARTY_TYPE,
                           p_context_code => :P21_DFF_CONTEXT);
                ```
            pageItemsToSubmit: [
                P21_PARTY_ID
                P21_DFF_CONTEXT
                P21_PARTY_TYPE
            ]
        }
        layout {
            sequence: 30
            slot: BODY
        }
        appearance {
            template: @/standard
            templateOptions: #DEFAULT#
        }
