            sqlQuery:
                ```sql
                select c.party_contact_id,
                       xxfnd_util_pkg.lookup_meaning('CONTACT_TYPE', c.contact_type) as contact_type,
                       c.contact_value,
                       c.contact_name,
                       c.primary_flag,
                       c.enabled_flag
                  from xxcmp_party_contacts c
                 where c.party_id = :P21_PARTY_ID
                 order by c.contact_type, c.primary_flag desc
                ```
